Hi Finn, Alex and Oliver,

Thank you for getting back to us, Finn. The answer is a very clear yes: we wo=
uld love to partner with Dojo. Dojo is a top priority for Vesopa, and we want=
 to bring it to our customers as early as we can.

We are ready to launch. Alex mentioned wanting to hear more about our solutio=
n and how we integrate, and the commercial side, so I have set up a kick-off =
call this Friday to cover all of it.

The one thing standing between us and launch is live API access. Our integrat=
ion runs today on our Dojo sandbox account, and we would like to agree what i=
s needed to move to live keys and our software house ID.

- Built: card payments go from Vesopa EPOS to the Dojo card machine beside it=
, with refunds and hosted checkout too.
- Tested: we have run the accreditation scenarios in the sandbox: sale, decli=
ne, cancelled, expired and signature.
- Ready: our till, kiosk, kitchen screen and customer display are already liv=
e on the Microsoft Store.

KICK-OFF CALL
Vesopa + Dojo kick-off call
Friday 9 October 2026, 10:00 to 10:45 UK time (BST)
Online meeting (joining link to follow)
The calendar invite is attached, so you can accept it from your inbox.
Add to Google Calendar: https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=3D=
