ction+to+Vesopa+and+a+live+demo+of+Vesopa+EPOS%0A2.+How+we+integrate+with+Doj=
o%2C+and+what+we+have+already+tested%0A3.+The+commercial+side+of+the+partners=
hip%0A4.+Live+API+access+for+Vesopa%2C+and+the+steps+and+dates+to+go+live%0A%=
0AIf+this+time+does+not+suit%2C+reply+to+muzahid%40vesopa.com+with+a+time+tha=
t+does.&add=3Dalex.radzio%40dojo.tech%2Cfintan.bridger%40paymentsense.com%2Co=
liver.england%40paymentsense.com%2Cinfo%40vesopasoftware.com%2Cinfo%40vesopa.=
com

What we would like to cover:
1. A short introduction to Vesopa and a live demo of Vesopa EPOS
2. How we integrate with Dojo, and what we have already tested
3. The commercial side of the partnership
4. Live API access for Vesopa, and the steps and dates to go live

If the time does not suit, just reply to this email with a time that works fo=
r you and we will fit around it.

We are looking forward to working with you.

Kind regards,
Muzahid Islam
